{"id":"vod_sn_36597","vodId":"36597","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔法禁书目录第一季","name_cn":"魔法禁书目录第一季","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/6973c5babf5d7790737aa8063a67c07e.jpg"},"summary":"自己的阳台栏杆上出现了像被单一样挂在上面的少女，这种非现实的情节出现在了上条当麻的眼前。虽然在这个城市——最先进科学引导的学院都市中，超能力已经可以通过科学技术创造出来，但是眼前这位自称“茵蒂克丝”的少女还是把上条当麻吓了一条。茵蒂克丝自称因拥有十万三千本魔导书而被魔法师追杀，而上条当麻靠自己的超能力也认定了少女的魔法。少女以危险为由离开上条家，上条如往日一般去学校学习，但放学回家，却发现茵蒂克丝倒在血泊之中。在科学与魔术交叉的世界中，上条当麻与茵蒂克丝的故事开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sdPD2uANKP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nu3sZyRFbG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HTzrM7fdGH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mS791fUNUM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hMByv5hhmF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/05FPs1jurk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/D1uXnNFmcr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ezp5x4bv2s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Nw3RLs2uMV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tTNrmdQ2HK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aJPBVBT7SL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m1Z3Zh1adK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RMsuPGuAS11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wESzmxJdkx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/91F